    turnFlow: '1. Draw 1, play 1, move. 2. To come out: Jack/Q/K/Ace or Joker. 3. 2-6, 9-10: move forward that many. Ace: come out or move 1. J/Q/K: come out or move 10. 7: forward 7 or split between 2 pegs. 8: move backward 8. Joker: jump to opponent/partner peg (sends opponent to start, partner to in-spot). 4. Land on opponent = send to start; land on partner = send to in-spot. 5. Must play a moving card if possible; Joker never forced.',
